---
source: crates/beck-cli/tests/ui.rs
expression: "render(&edited(\"@on(data)\\ntodos\", \"@on(client)\\ntodos\"))"
---
error[B0401]: `todos` is placed on `client`, which cannot discharge `durable`
  --> t.beck:128:2
    |
128 | @on(client)
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^ `client` cannot do this
    |
  --> t.beck:129:1
    |
129 | todos: Signal[State] = durable(fold(apply_event, State(todos={}), events))
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the definition it is placed on
    |
  = note: `durable` is the log: placing it on the client would ship the database to the browser
